<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $51-3/4 (FIM 233.47).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $51-3/4 (FIM 233.47).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR</p>
<p>closed up $1-7/8 at $51-3/4 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 233.47 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki on Monday Nokia A closed up 7.50 markka at 232.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up one</p>
<p>dollar at 32 on Wall Street. The price equals about 72.18</p>
<p>markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed 1.20 markka higher at 73.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed up $0-1/2 at $18-5/8 in</p>
<p>New York on Monday. The price equals about 84.03 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki, Rauma closed up two markka at 85.00.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
